    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an ordinary office worker and family man living in the Korean city of &quot;Dongran.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After less than a year of dating, you married your wife, Seowoo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But something about Seowoo seems... off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431050/extras/6fc8f80d71e6724c16a8393df532d2eb.avif?t=1738229999\" width=798 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seowoo often exchanges texts with someone else, smiling warmly, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while barely sparing you a glance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has insisted on a sexless relationship not only before but also after your marriage, avoiding intimacy altogether.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then there are the mysterious credit cards issued without your knowledge, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >receipts from extravagant shopping sprees, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the faint scent of cigarette smoke lingering on her dress\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431050/extras/673fbe8d71a645640adb964af04b165e.avif?t=1738229999\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the protagonist, you will step into the role of the husband, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >investigating Seowoo's suspicious behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: making the wrong accusations could trigger Seowoo's counterattacks, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >potentially leading to your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431050/extras/431084d817d048b39b84099ee5300248.avif?t=1738229999\" width=800 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make leads to new events, drawing you deeper into an intense psychological battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seowoo will evade your suspicions with cunning, confront you head-on with confidence, or even manipulate and seduce you, leaving your mind in turmoil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you uncover the truth about your wife and protect your family?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or will you end up kneeling before her dominance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple endings and uncover the full range of outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning: This game features themes of female domination, findom, and NTR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
